  "details": "Screen-space textures are broken and are effecting visual clarity... appearing very blurry and making text often becoming completely illegible.\n\nI believe this may be related to the aspect ratio of images, as 16:9 images appear to be effected majority of the time while 1:1 images do not appear to be effected if ever.\n\nWith most desktop monitors being 16:9 it would be silly to use 1:1 textures while still possible, yet quite annoying.\n\nI know this is a bug due to nothing of the sort being posted in patch notes!\n\nthis issue appears to originate from BUILD 1435.",
